  {"id":"RIGAKU-R60-AM-041","subject":"臨床医学大要","topic":"前十字靱帯損傷","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"前十字靱帯（ACL）の損傷が疑われる膝で、脛骨の大腿骨に対する前方移動を評価する代表的な徒手検査はどれか。","choices":["Lachmanテスト","Thomasテスト","Finkelsteinテスト","Phalenテスト","Trendelenburgテスト"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"ACL＝Lachman。脛骨の前方移動と終末感をみる。","explanation":"LachmanテストはACLの連続性を評価する代表的な徒手検査で、大腿骨に対する脛骨の前方移動量と終末感を確認する。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Bookshelf Lachman Test","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08a_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK554415/","https://www.mhlw.go.jp/general/sikaku/successlist/2025/siken08_09/dl/PT_seitou.pdf"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"41","rightsBasis":"ACL損傷評価の医学的論点を確認し、文章・選択肢・解説を独自作成。図版は不使用。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},
  {"id":"RIGAKU-R60-AM-042","subject":"理学療法","topic":"日本の理学療法士養成の歴史","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"日本で最初の理学療法士・作業療法士養成校である国立療養所東京病院附属リハビリテーション学院が開校した年はどれか。","choices":["1955年","1960年","1963年","1966年","1972年"],"correctIndices":[2],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"1963年に日本初の養成校、1965年に法公布、1966年に第1回国家試験。","explanation":"日本理学療法士協会の沿革では、1963年に国立療養所東京病院附属リハビリテーション学院が日本初の理学療法士・作業療法士養成校として開校し、1965年に理学療法士及び作業療法士法が公布、1966年に第1回国家試験が実施された。","sourceTitle":"公益社団法人 日本理学療法士協会 協会情報","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08a_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.japanpt.or.jp/about/info/","https://www.mhlw.go.jp/web/t_doc?dataId=00000880&dataType=0&pageNo=1","https://www.mhlw.go.jp/general/sikaku/successlist/2025/siken08_09/dl/PT_seitou.pdf"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"42","rightsBasis":"日本理学療法士協会と厚生労働省の沿革・告示を根拠に独自作問。写真・年表画像は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},
  {"id":"RIGAKU-R60-AM-043","subject":"リハビリテーション医学","topic":"脊髄小脳変性症と集中リハビリテーション","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"歩行可能な脊髄小脳変性症患者へのリハビリテーションについて、最も適切なのはどれか。","choices":["運動失調があるため運動練習は原則禁忌である","短期集中した協調・バランス・歩行練習で運動失調や歩行能力の改善が期待できる","筋力増強だけを行い協調運動は避ける","症状改善効果は報告されていない","入院中の訓練後は自主練習を行わない方がよい"],"correctIndices":[1],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"SCDでも集中リハは有効。協調・バランス・歩行を反復し、継続が重要。","explanation":"変性性小脳疾患を対象とした試験では、4週間の集中的な理学・作業療法により運動失調、歩行、ADLの短期改善が報告されている。継続的な自主練習も効果維持に重要とされる。","sourceTitle":"Cerebellar ataxia rehabilitation trial","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08a_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/22140200/","https://www.nanbyou.or.jp/entry/4881","https://www.mhlw.go.jp/general/sikaku/successlist/2025/siken08_09/dl/PT_seitou.pdf"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"43","rightsBasis":"研究結果と難病情報センターの一般情報を根拠に独自作問。尺度項目や図表は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},
  {"id":"RIGAKU-R60-AM-044","subject":"臨床医学大要","topic":"Gowers徴候と筋ジストロフィー","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"床から立ち上がる際、両手を床についた後に自分の大腿を手で押しながら体幹を起こすGowers徴候が示唆するのはどれか。","choices":["近位筋優位の筋力低下","手指屈筋だけの筋力低下","前庭機能だけの障害","感覚性失語","末梢視野障害"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"Gowers徴候＝骨盤帯を中心とする近位筋力低下。DMDで代表的。","explanation":"Gowers徴候は近位筋力低下を代償して立ち上がる所見で、Duchenne型筋ジストロフィーなどの神経筋疾患でみられる。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Bookshelf Gower Sign","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08a_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK540973/","https://www.mhlw.go.jp/general/sikaku/successlist/2025/siken08_09/dl/PT_seitou.pdf"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"44","rightsBasis":"臨床徴候の医学的意味を独自文章で作問。写真・動画は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},
  {"id":"RIGAKU-R60-AM-045","subject":"運動学","topic":"正常歩行と膝伸展モーメント","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"正常歩行の荷重応答期に膝が軽度屈曲して衝撃を吸収するとき、その屈曲を主に遠心性に制御する筋群はどれか。","choices":["大腿四頭筋","ハムストリングスのみ","前脛骨筋","腓腹筋のみ","股関節内転筋"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"荷重応答期の膝屈曲は大腿四頭筋の遠心性収縮で制御。","explanation":"荷重応答期では床反力による外的膝屈曲モーメントに対し、大腿四頭筋が遠心性に働いて膝屈曲を制御し、衝撃吸収と支持性に寄与する。","sourceTitle":"Biomechanics of loading response","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08a_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6656910/","https://www.mhlw.go.jp/general/sikaku/successlist/2025/siken08_09/dl/PT_seitou.pdf"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"45","rightsBasis":"歩行運動学の一般原理を研究資料で確認し独自作問。グラフ・図は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},
  {"id":"RIGAKU-R60-AM-046","subject":"解剖学","topic":"錐体外路","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"錐体外路系に含まれる下行路はどれか。","choices":["外側皮質脊髄路","網様体脊髄路","後索","外側脊髄視床路","薄束"],"correctIndices":[1],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"錐体外路＝網様体・前庭・赤核・視蓋脊髄路など。","explanation":"錐体外路系には網様体脊髄路、前庭脊髄路、赤核脊髄路、視蓋脊髄路などが含まれ、姿勢や筋緊張、粗大な運動調節に関与する。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Bookshelf Extrapyramidal System","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08a_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK554542/","https://www.mhlw.go.jp/general/sikaku/successlist/2025/siken08_09/dl/PT_seitou.pdf"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"46","rightsBasis":"神経解剖の一般概念を独自作問。図版は不使用。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},
  {"id":"RIGAKU-R60-AM-047","subject":"生理学","topic":"自律神経障害の症候","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"自律神経系の機能障害で生じ得る症状はどれか。","choices":["起立時の血圧低下","骨折部の転位","失語症のみ","関節拘縮のみ","腱板断裂"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"自律神経は血圧・心拍・消化・排尿・体温調節などを担う。","explanation":"自律神経系は心拍、血圧、消化、排尿などの不随意機能を調節するため、障害されると起立性低血圧、消化管運動異常、排尿障害などが生じ得る。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Bookshelf Autonomic Nervous System","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08a_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK539845/","https://www.mhlw.go.jp/general/sikaku/successlist/2025/siken08_09/dl/PT_seitou.pdf"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"47","rightsBasis":"自律神経の生理学的機能から独自作問。図表は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},
  {"id":"RIGAKU-R60-AM-048","subject":"臨床医学大要","topic":"小脳梗塞","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"急性小脳梗塞で典型的にみられ得る症状の組合せはどれか。","choices":["突然のめまい・嘔気・歩行失調","慢性の黄疸・腹水・吐血","発熱・咳・膿性痰のみ","多尿・口渇・体重減少のみ","関節腫脹・朝のこわばりのみ"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"小脳梗塞は突然のめまい、嘔気・嘔吐、歩行失調に注意。","explanation":"小脳梗塞では病変部位により多様な症状が出るが、急なめまい、嘔気・嘔吐、歩行失調は代表的な症状である。急性発症の強い平衡障害では中枢性病変を見逃さないことが重要となる。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Bookshelf Cerebellar Infarction","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08a_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK470416/","https://www.mhlw.go.jp/general/sikaku/successlist/2025/siken08_09/dl/PT_seitou.pdf"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"48","rightsBasis":"症候の医学的特徴を独自文章で作問。画像・症例文は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},
  {"id":"RIGAKU-R60-AM-049","subject":"理学療法","topic":"ランダム化比較試験の研究デザイン","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"理学療法介入Aと介入Bの効果を比較するランダム化比較試験で、ランダム化が直接行うのはどれか。","choices":["対象者を介入群へ偶然性を用いて割り付ける","結果が有意になるまで対象者を除外する","研究者が好みで群を選ぶ","すべての対象者を同じ介入にする","介入後に群分けを決める"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"RCTのランダム化＝介入群への割付を偶然性で決め、選択バイアスを抑える。","explanation":"ランダム化比較試験では、比較する介入群への割付を偶然性を用いて行う。これは研究者や参加者の選択による割付の偏りを抑え、群間の比較可能性を高めるために用いられる。","sourceTitle":"NLM Randomized Controlled Trial definition","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08a_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/68016449","https://www.mhlw.go.jp/general/sikaku/successlist/2025/siken08_09/dl/PT_seitou.pdf"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"49","rightsBasis":"研究デザインの定義を根拠に、臨床例・選択肢・解説を独自作成。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},
  {"id":"RIGAKU-R60-AM-050","subject":"リハビリテーション医学","topic":"三次予防と社会復帰","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"脳卒中後に残った機能障害の影響を減らし、生活の自立や社会参加を高めるためにリハビリテーションを行う。予防医学上の位置づけはどれか。","choices":["一次予防","二次予防","三次予防","曝露前予防だけ","集団免疫"],"correctIndices":[2],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"三次予防＝すでに生じた疾患・障害の影響を減らし、機能・参加を高める。","explanation":"三次予防は既に存在する健康状態や機能障害の影響を軽減し、活動制限の予防、自立、参加・社会包摂を促す段階で、リハビリテーションが代表的な手段となる。","sourceTitle":"WHO Community-Based Rehabilitation Guidelines","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08a_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK310943/","https://www.mhlw.go.jp/general/sikaku/successlist/2025/siken08_09/dl/PT_seitou.pdf"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"50","rightsBasis":"WHOの三次予防概念を根拠に独自作問。図表は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},
  {"id":"RIGAKU-R60-AM-051","subject":"解剖学","topic":"下腿区画と神経支配","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"下腿前方区画を走行し、前脛骨筋など足関節背屈筋群を主に支配する神経はどれか。","choices":["深腓骨神経","浅腓骨神経","脛骨神経","閉鎖神経","上殿神経"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"下腿前方区画＝深腓骨神経、外側区画＝浅腓骨神経。","explanation":"総腓骨神経は浅腓骨神経と深腓骨神経に分かれ、深腓骨神経は下腿前方区画を走行して前脛骨筋、長母趾伸筋、長趾伸筋などを支配する。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Bookshelf Common Fibular Nerve","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08a_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK532968/","https://www.mhlw.go.jp/general/sikaku/successlist/2025/siken08_09/dl/PT_seitou.pdf"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"51","rightsBasis":"公式断面図は第三者権利未解決のため一切使用せず、同じ解剖論点を文章問題へ独自置換。","originType":"originalized_without_official_media","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},
  {"id":"RIGAKU-R60-AM-052","subject":"解剖学","topic":"関節唇","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"関節窩の縁を線維軟骨性の関節唇が取り囲み、関節の安定性に寄与する関節の組合せはどれか。","choices":["肩関節と股関節","肘関節と距腿関節","膝関節と近位脛腓関節","手関節と指節間関節","胸鎖関節と顎関節"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"肩＝関節窩唇、股＝寛骨臼唇。どちらも関節窩を深くし安定性に寄与。","explanation":"肩関節には関節窩唇、股関節には寛骨臼唇があり、それぞれ関節窩の縁を取り囲んで関節面を深くし、安定性に寄与する。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Bookshelf Hip and Shoulder anatomy","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08a_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK526019/","https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK534836/","https://www.mhlw.go.jp/general/sikaku/successlist/2025/siken08_09/dl/PT_seitou.pdf"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"52","rightsBasis":"関節唇の一般解剖を根拠に独自作問。解剖図は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},
  {"id":"RIGAKU-R60-AM-053","subject":"解剖学","topic":"脳神経の運動成分","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"純粋な運動神経として分類される脳神経はどれか。","choices":["視神経","三叉神経","顔面神経","迷走神経","外転神経"],"correctIndices":[4],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"純運動＝III・IV・VI・XI・XII。純感覚＝I・II・VIII。","explanation":"外転神経（第VI脳神経）は純粋な運動神経で、外側直筋を支配して眼球外転に働く。三叉・顔面・迷走神経は複数の機能成分を含む。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Bookshelf Cranial Nerve","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08a_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK470353/","https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK430711/","https://www.mhlw.go.jp/general/sikaku/successlist/2025/siken08_09/dl/PT_seitou.pdf"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"53","rightsBasis":"脳神経機能の一般解剖を独自作問。図版は不使用。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},
  {"id":"RIGAKU-R60-AM-054","subject":"解剖学","topic":"尺骨神経支配筋","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"尺骨神経深枝が支配する手内在筋はどれか。","choices":["短母指外転筋","母指内転筋","長母指伸筋","浅指屈筋","円回内筋"],"correctIndices":[1],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"尺骨神経＝骨間筋・母指内転筋・第3/4虫様筋・小指球筋など。","explanation":"母指内転筋は尺骨神経深枝に支配される。短母指外転筋は主に正中神経、長母指伸筋は橈骨神経、浅指屈筋と円回内筋は正中神経の支配である。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Bookshelf Ulnar Nerve","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08a_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK499892/","https://www.mhlw.go.jp/general/sikaku/successlist/2025/siken08_09/dl/PT_seitou.pdf"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"54","rightsBasis":"末梢神経支配の解剖学的事実を独自問題化。図版は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},
  {"id":"RIGAKU-R60-AM-055","subject":"解剖学","topic":"食道の解剖","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"食道が横隔膜を通過する高さとして代表的なのはどれか。","choices":["C6","T4","T8","T10","L2"],"correctIndices":[3],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"食道裂孔＝T10。大静脈T8、大動脈T12とセットで覚える。","explanation":"食道は咽頭から連続して胸郭内を下行し、横隔膜の食道裂孔をおおむねT10椎体レベルで通過する。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Bookshelf Esophageal Anatomy","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08a_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK532298/","https://www.mhlw.go.jp/general/sikaku/successlist/2025/siken08_09/dl/PT_seitou.pdf"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"55","rightsBasis":"食道の基本解剖を独自作問。解剖図は不使用。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},
  {"id":"RIGAKU-R60-AM-056","subject":"生理学","topic":"下垂体後葉ホルモン","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"視床下部で合成され、下垂体後葉から血中へ放出されるホルモンはどれか。","choices":["成長ホルモン","甲状腺刺激ホルモン","副腎皮質刺激ホルモン","バソプレシン（ADH）","卵胞刺激ホルモン"],"correctIndices":[3],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"後葉＝ADHとオキシトシン。合成は視床下部、後葉は貯蔵・放出。","explanation":"バソプレシン（ADH）とオキシトシンは視床下部の神経分泌細胞で合成され、軸索輸送後に下垂体後葉から放出される。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Bookshelf Pituitary Gland Physiology","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08a_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK459247/","https://www.mhlw.go.jp/general/sikaku/successlist/2025/siken08_09/dl/PT_seitou.pdf"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"56","rightsBasis":"内分泌生理の一般事実を独自作問。図版は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},
  {"id":"RIGAKU-R60-AM-057","subject":"解剖学","topic":"視覚器","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"網膜の中心窩で密度が最も高く、明所視と高い空間分解能に重要な視細胞はどれか。","choices":["杆体","錐体","双極細胞","水平細胞","神経節細胞"],"correctIndices":[1],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"中心窩＝錐体が高密度、杆体は中心窩にほぼ存在しない。","explanation":"中心窩では錐体の密度が非常に高く、杆体は中心部に存在しない。錐体は明所視、色覚、高い視力に重要である。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Bookshelf Retina","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08a_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK545310/","https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK10848/","https://www.mhlw.go.jp/general/sikaku/successlist/2025/siken08_09/dl/PT_seitou.pdf"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"57","rightsBasis":"視細胞分布の一般解剖を独自作問。網膜図は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},
  {"id":"RIGAKU-R60-AM-058","subject":"解剖学","topic":"動脈と触診部位","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"足背動脈の脈拍を触診する部位として適切なのはどれか。","choices":["足背で長母趾伸筋腱の外側付近","外果直後","膝蓋骨中央","上前腸骨棘直上","踵骨隆起中央"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"足背動脈＝足背、長母趾伸筋腱の外側付近。後脛骨動脈＝内果後方。","explanation":"足背動脈は足背を走り、長母趾伸筋腱の外側付近で触知する。後脛骨動脈は内果後方で触知する。解剖学的変異により足背動脈が触れにくい場合もある。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Bookshelf Peripheral Pulse","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08a_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK542175/","https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK560912/","https://www.mhlw.go.jp/general/sikaku/successlist/2025/siken08_09/dl/PT_seitou.pdf"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"58","rightsBasis":"脈拍触診の基本解剖を独自作問。図版は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},
  {"id":"RIGAKU-R60-AM-059","subject":"解剖学","topic":"脊髄運動ニューロン","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"骨格筋の錘外筋線維を直接支配するα運動ニューロンの細胞体が脊髄内で存在する部位はどれか。","choices":["後角","前角","後索","側索のみ","中心管"],"correctIndices":[1],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"α運動ニューロン＝前角細胞→前根→骨格筋錘外筋線維。","explanation":"脊髄のα運動ニューロンは前角に細胞体を持ち、軸索が前根から末梢神経へ入り骨格筋の錘外筋線維を直接支配する。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Bookshelf Motor Neuron","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08a_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK554616/","https://www.mhlw.go.jp/general/sikaku/successlist/2025/siken08_09/dl/PT_seitou.pdf"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"59","rightsBasis":"運動ニューロンの基本解剖を独自作問。組織図・模式図は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},
  {"id":"RIGAKU-R60-AM-060","subject":"解剖学","topic":"被殻を灌流する動脈","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"被殻の大部分を灌流する穿通枝として代表的なのはどれか。","choices":["中大脳動脈から分岐する外側レンズ核線条体動脈","前脊髄動脈","後下小脳動脈","眼動脈","浅側頭動脈"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"被殻・基底核＝MCAのレンズ核線条体動脈を重要セットで覚える。","explanation":"外側レンズ核線条体動脈は主に中大脳動脈から分岐する穿通枝で、被殻を含む基底核や内包の一部を灌流する。小血管閉塞ではラクナ梗塞の原因となり得る。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Bookshelf Striate Arteries","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08a_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK545222/","https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK526002/","https://www.mhlw.go.jp/general/sikaku/successlist/2025/siken08_09/dl/PT_seitou.pdf"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"60","rightsBasis":"脳血管解剖の一般事実を独自作問。血管図・画像は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"}
